cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
title: "WTO–GATS Reasoning Engine: structured, explainable analysis of measures affecting trade in services"
abstract: >-
  Open-source research and teaching tool that walks a regulatory measure through the GATS analysis
  developed in WTO jurisprudence (scope, MFN, specific commitments, market access, national treatment,
  domestic regulation, Articles XIV and XIV bis, prudential carve-out), citing provisions and disputes
  for every step and reporting information gaps. Includes illustrative scenarios on the EU Data Act.
type: software
authors:
